#: index.docbook:8
#. Tag: title
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kamera; : Digital Camera"
msgstr "& कॅमेरा; : डिजिटल कैमरा"

#: index.docbook:12
#. Tag: author
#, no-c-format
msgid "<firstname>Burkhard</firstname> <surname>Lück</surname>"
msgstr "<firstname>बुर्खार्ड</firstname> <उपनाम>लुक्</surname>"

#: index.docbook:16
#. Tag: email
#, no-c-format
msgid "lueck@hube-lueck.de"
msgstr "lueck@hube-lueck.de"

#: index.docbook:19
#. Tag: trans_comment
#, no-c-format
msgid "ROLES_OF_TRANSLATORS"
msgstr "अनुवादकानां_भूमिका"

#: index.docbook:22
#. Tag: date
#, no-c-format
msgid "2018-03-23"
msgstr "२०१८-०३-२३"

#: index.docbook:23
#. Tag: releaseinfo
#, no-c-format
msgid "Applications 18.04"
msgstr "अनुप्रयोगाः १८.०४"

#: index.docbook:26
#. Tag: keyword
#, no-c-format
msgid "<keyword>KDE</keyword>"
msgstr "<keyword>WHERE</keyword> इति"

#: index.docbook:27
#. Tag: keyword
#, no-c-format
msgid "camera"
msgstr "कॅमेरा"

#: index.docbook:28
#. Tag: keyword
#, no-c-format
msgid "photo"
msgstr "चित्रं"

#: index.docbook:32
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "This module allows you to configure support for your digital camera."
msgstr "एतत् मॉड्यूल् भवन्तं स्वस्य डिजिटल-कॅमेरा-समर्थनं विन्यस्तुं शक्नोति ।"

#: index.docbook:37
#. Tag: guibutton
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guibutton>Add</guibutton>"
msgstr "<guibutton>जोड</guibutton> इति"

#: index.docbook:39
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click this button to select the camera's model and the port it is connected "
"to on your computer (&eg; USB, Serial). If your camera does not appear in "
"the list of <guilabel>Supported Cameras</guilabel>, go to the <ulink "
"url=\"http://www.gphoto.org\">GPhoto web site</ulink> for a possible update."
msgstr ""
"कॅमेरा-माडलं चयनं कर्तुं एतत् बटन् नुदन्तु, तस्य पोर्ट् च यत् भवतः सङ्गणके "
"(&eg; USB, Serial) सम्बद्धम् अस्ति । यदि भवतः कॅमेरा "
"<guilabel>समर्थितकॅमेरा</guilabel> इत्यस्य सूचीयां न दृश्यते तर्हि "
"सम्भाव्य-अद्यतनार्थं <ulink url=\"http://www.gphoto.org\">GPhoto "
"जालस्थलं</ulink> गच्छन्तु ."

#: index.docbook:48
#. Tag: guibutton
#, no-c-format
msgid "Test"
msgstr "परीक्षा"

#: index.docbook:50
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Click this button to test the connection to the selected camera."
msgstr "चयनितकैमरेण सह संयोजनस्य परीक्षणार्थं एतत् बटन् नुदन्तु ।"

#: index.docbook:54
#. Tag: guibutton
#, no-c-format
msgid "Remove"
msgstr "अपाकरोति"

#: index.docbook:56
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Removes the selected camera from the list."
msgstr "चयनितं कॅमेरा सूचीतः निष्कासयति ।"

#: index.docbook:61
#. Tag: guibutton
#, no-c-format
msgid "Configure"
msgstr "विन्यस्तं कुर्वन्तु"

#: index.docbook:63
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click this button to change the configuration of the selected camera. The "
"availability of this feature and the contents of the Configuration dialog "
"depend on the camera model."
msgstr ""
"चयनितस्य कॅमेरा-विन्यासं परिवर्तयितुं एतत् बटन् नुदन्तु । अस्य विशेषतायाः "
"उपलब्धता, Configuration संवादस्य विषयवस्तु च कॅमेरा मॉडल् इत्यस्य उपरि "
"निर्भरं भवति ।"

#: index.docbook:69
#. Tag: guibutton
#, no-c-format
msgid "Information"
msgstr "सूचना"

#: index.docbook:71
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click this button to view a summary of the current status of the selected "
"camera. The availability of this feature and the contents of the "
"Information dialog depend on the camera model."
msgstr ""
"चयनितस्य कॅमेरा इत्यस्य वर्तमानस्थितेः सारांशं द्रष्टुं एतत् बटन् नुदन्तु । "
"अस्य विशेषतायाः उपलब्धता सूचनासंवादस्य विषयवस्तु च कॅमेरा-प्रतिरूपस्य उपरि "
"निर्भरं भवति ।"

#: index.docbook:77
#. Tag: guibutton
#, no-c-format
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "निरसयतु"

#: index.docbook:79
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid "Click this button to cancel the current camera operation."
msgstr "वर्तमानं कॅमेरा-सञ्चालनं रद्दं कर्तुं एतत् बटन् नुदन्तु ।"

#: index.docbook:85
#. Tag: para
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To view and download images from the digital camera, enter "
"<userinput>camera:/</userinput> in &konqueror;&apos;s or &dolphin;&apos;s "
"location bar."
msgstr ""
"डिजिटलकैमरातः चित्राणि द्रष्टुं डाउनलोड् कर्तुं च &konqueror;&apos;s अथवा "
"&dolphin;&apos;s स्थानपट्टिकायां <userinput>camera:/</userinput> इति "
"प्रविशन्तु ।"
